01:25:21.000 --> 01:25:22.440
And that is very, very exciting.

01:25:22.440 --> 01:25:25.830
Let me open up a new
terminal over here.

01:25:25.830 --> 01:25:30.540
All I have to do
is type "rayfin up".

01:25:30.540 --> 01:25:33.679
And then. . . Demo
Gods, bless us -- come on!

01:25:33.712 --> 01:25:35.985
It will. . .

01:25:36.018 --> 01:25:38.270
maybe deploy!

01:25:38.270 --> 01:25:39.560
Blamo! It's happening!

01:25:39.560 --> 01:25:40.790
Yes!

01:25:40.790 --> 01:25:43.880
And all hosted on
Microsoft Fabric.

01:25:43.880 --> 01:25:45.110
Okay, I know that's a lot.

01:25:45.110 --> 01:25:46.680
I know that's a lot.

01:25:46.680 --> 01:25:49.800
With Rayfin, your agents get a
complete enterprise backend

01:25:49.800 --> 01:25:51.210
so you can deploy
with confidence

01:25:51.210 --> 01:25:52.890
in the way that's best for you.

01:25:52.890 --> 01:25:55.080
But this is the key
thing to remember:

01:25:55.080 --> 01:25:58.920
This app is not just
another session manager --

01:25:58.920 --> 01:26:00.180
-- yes, it is.

01:26:00.180 --> 01:26:01.710
It manages a lot of sessions.

01:26:01.710 --> 01:26:05.460
But session managers just
