That's 12 orders of magnitude of
computation in just 15 years.

01:48:45.780 --> 01:48:49.530
It's now clear that a
consistent, exponential increase

01:48:49.530 --> 01:48:51.300
in computation leads

01:48:51.300 --> 01:48:56.160
to predictable advances
in AI capabilities.

01:48:56.160 --> 01:48:59.460
And in the next few years, we're
going to see three more orders

01:48:59.460 --> 01:49:04.140
of magnitude of compute applied
to train Frontier models.

01:49:04.140 --> 01:49:07.290
Intelligence is now a
function of compute.

01:49:07.290 --> 01:49:10.140
Log linear hill climbing
has become the norm.

01:49:10.140 --> 01:49:12.720
The scaling laws are
clearly holding,

01:49:12.720 --> 01:49:17.070
and it is a remarkable
time in our industry.

01:49:17.070 --> 01:49:19.500
And so, in this context,

01:49:19.500 --> 01:49:22.980
we at MAI are building
towards what we call humanist

01:49:22.980 --> 01:49:27.390
superintelligence,
state-of-the-art AI capabilities

01:49:27.390 --> 01:49:30.300
that are explicitly
designed to serve people

01:49:30.300 --> 01:49:34.110
and organizations and
not replace them.

01:49:34.110 --> 01:49:39.570
Because the type of AI that
we create really does matter.

01:49:39.570 --> 01:49:43.470
We need an AI that
places humanity first,

01:49:43.470 --> 01:49:49.470
but always prioritizes human
well-being and human progress.

01:49:49.470 --> 01:49:51.240
This is the core philosophy

01:49:51.240 --> 01:49:54.840
and motivation behind our
superintelligence efforts

01:49:54.840 --> 01:49:58.680
at Microsoft, and it shapes
everything that we do.

01:49:58.680 --> 01:50:02.700
And as a platform company,
our job and our commitment is

01:50:02.700 --> 01:50:06.900
to keep you developers building
