02:07:43.530 --> 02:07:45.180
Now, as you can see here,

02:07:45.180 --> 02:07:49.050
the agent has leveraged
"Test-Time Tree Search"

02:07:49.050 --> 02:07:53.700
with multiple models,
including a fine-tuned model.

02:07:53.700 --> 02:07:56.610
And what you see
here is a summary

02:07:56.610 --> 02:07:58.410
that doesn't feel generic.

02:07:58.410 --> 02:08:01.530
It feels undoubtedly
Land O'Lakes.

02:08:01.530 --> 02:08:02.940
And that's not it.

02:08:02.940 --> 02:08:06.210
The task holds itself
to high standards,

02:08:06.210 --> 02:08:11.220
